{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B1.2\", \"B1.4\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"承接前一段对轻松的留恋，音乐先把几乎要冲出去的势头收住：渴望仍在，却不再急着兑现，喜欢本身开始压过索取。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B2.1\", \"B2.2\", \"B3.1\", \"B3.2\", \"B3.3\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"同一转向也让明亮退成带雾的暗色、让注意力向内收拢；他不急着迈向下一步，而是回听刚才的余响，追问那份感受是否真实、接下来又该怎么办。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [],\n      \"beads\": [\"B4.1\", \"B4.2\", \"B4.3\"],\n      \"alt\": true,\n      \"note\": \"也可以听成：激动倾诉后忽然望见夜空，意识到眼前的美好大过自己的愿望；不安仍在，却暂时不再占据全部心思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S09-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.3\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"到第76–77小节，飘渺的颤音和轻柔的和弦把这份尚未彻底松开的动容悬在半空。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"],\n      \"why\": \"尽兴之后，他不再被满足欲望的冲势牵着走，喜欢本身成为情感重心，因此既有欲望收住、情绪悬停的主体验，也有声色转暗、注意力内收和回听余响的侧面。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这组明确是替代B3的另一种听法，把停顿解释为仰望夜空、感到美好超出愿望，属于另一条意象路径，不能并入S09-1所讲的情感转向。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "94687a15-395b-4f16-a49b-5979b48e6fb8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T064702915069Z", "elapsed_seconds": 170.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T06:49:53.024137+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d05dec276ab8b325540674374c030f6f1d758c50dc7ca54d2a63db9a782c3e35", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_compl